{
  "__inputs": [{"name":"DS_VICTORIAMETRICS","label":"VictoriaMetrics","type":"datasource","pluginId":"prometheus"}],
  "__requires": [
    {"type":"grafana","id":"grafana","name":"Grafana","version":"12.0.0"},
    {"type":"datasource","id":"prometheus","name":"Prometheus","version":"1.0.0"},
    {"type":"panel","id":"stat","name":"Stat","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"timeseries","name":"Time series","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"bargauge","name":"Bar gauge","version":""},
    {"type":"panel","id":"text","name":"Text","version":""}
  ],
  "uid": "copilot-otel-agent-performance",
  "title": "Copilot — Agent and Session Performance",
  "description": "Agent session counts, duration, turns per session, and response latency from VS OTel instrumentation.",
  "tags": ["copilot","otel","agent","session","latency","performance"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1h",
  "time": {"from": "now-28d", "to": "now"},
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {"list": [
    {
      "name": "service",
      "type": "query",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count, service_name)",
      "refresh": 2,
      "multi": true,
      "includeAll": true,
      "allValue": ".*",
      "label": "Service",
      "current": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "model",
      "type": "query",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "query": "label_values(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}, gen_ai_request_model)",
      "refresh": 2,
      "multi": true,
      "includeAll": true,
      "allValue": ".*",
      "label": "Model",
      "current": {}
    }
  ]},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About This Dashboard",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## Copilot Agent and Session Performance\n\nAgent session metrics and response latency from Visual Studio OTel instrumentation. These metrics reflect how Copilot performs in agent mode — how long sessions run, how many turns they take, how fast the model responds, and where errors occur.\n\n**Key metrics**\n- **Agent invocation duration** — total time from agent start to completion\n- **Agent turn count** — how many back-and-forth steps an agent session takes\n- **Time to first token** — how long developers wait before seeing the first response character\n- **Time per output chunk** — streaming speed — how fast the response arrives\n- **Cloud errors** — failed agent operations\n\n**Service filter** — `copilot-chat` covers agent mode. `github-copilot` covers completions.\n\n**Note:** No user attribution — these are enterprise totals from VS OTel instrumentation."}
    },
    {
      "id": 100, "type": "row", "title": "Session Summary",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Agent Sessions",
      "description": "Total number of Copilot agent sessions started across the enterprise in the selected window. Each session is one agent invocation from start to completion. Source: copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration_count.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration_count[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Agent Sessions", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Agent Session Duration (s)",
      "description": "Average duration of a Copilot agent session from start to completion in seconds. Longer sessions indicate more complex multi-step tasks. Sessions over 60 seconds typically involve multiple tool calls and code generation steps. Source: copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration_sum[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration_count[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg Duration s", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"}, "unit": "s", "decimals": 1}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Turns per Agent Session",
      "description": "Average number of turns per agent session. A turn is one round of the agent thinking, calling tools, and generating output. More turns indicate more complex tasks. Very high turn counts (above 20) may indicate the agent is struggling to complete a task. Source: copilot_chat_agent_turn_count.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_turn_count_sum[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_turn_count_count[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg Turns", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#F0954A"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 1}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Cloud Agent Errors",
      "description": "Total number of cloud agent errors across the enterprise in the selected window. Errors indicate failed agent operations — network issues, model errors, or tool failures. A rising error count warrants investigation. Source: copilot_chat_cloud_error_count.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_cloud_error_count[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Cloud Errors", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#E0524A"}, "unit": "locale", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 101, "type": "row", "title": "Response Latency",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Time to First Token (ms)",
      "description": "Average time in milliseconds from prompt submission to the first token of the response appearing. This is the key perceived latency metric for developers — high values feel like the model is slow to respond even if overall throughput is fine. Source: copilot_chat_time_to_first_token.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "1000 * sum(increase(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg TTFT ms", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"}, "unit": "ms", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Time per Output Chunk (ms)",
      "description": "Average time between streamed output chunks in milliseconds. This controls the streaming speed — how fast the response flows to the developer after the first token. Lower is faster. Source: gen_ai_client_time_per_output_chunk.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "1000 * sum(increase(gen_ai_client_time_per_output_chunk_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(gen_ai_client_time_per_output_chunk_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg Chunk ms", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"}, "unit": "ms", "decimals": 1}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "stat", "title": "Avg Total Operation Duration (ms)",
      "description": "Average total LLM operation duration from request to final response in milliseconds. This is the end-to-end latency per prompt. Source: gen_ai_client_operation_duration.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 11},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "1000 * sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])), 1)", "legendFormat": "Avg Op Duration ms", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"}, "unit": "ms", "decimals": 0}},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "id": 102, "type": "row", "title": "Latency Trends",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Time to First Token Over Time",
      "description": "Daily average time to first token in milliseconds. Spikes indicate periods of model or infrastructure latency. Compare across models using the Model filter to identify which models are slower to respond.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "1000 * sum(rate(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_sum{service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])), 0.001)", "legendFormat": "Avg TTFT ms", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms", "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}}},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Agent Session Count Over Time",
      "description": "Daily agent session count. Rising trend indicates growing agent mode adoption. Use alongside the Tool Call Analytics dashboard to understand how session growth correlates with tool call volume.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_agent_invocation_duration_count[1d]))", "legendFormat": "Agent Sessions", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "locale", "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 75, "lineWidth": 2}}},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 103, "type": "row", "title": "Latency by Model",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25}, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Avg Time to First Token by Model (ms)",
      "description": "Average time to first token per model. Faster models respond quicker which improves developer experience. Use this to compare model latency characteristics and inform model selection recommendations for time-sensitive workflows.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 26},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sort_desc(1000 * sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(copilot_chat_time_to_first_token_count{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])), 1))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}, "mappings": []}},
      "options": {"orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "valueMode": "color", "namePlacement": "left", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 16, "maxVizHeight": 300},
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Avg Total Operation Duration by Model (ms)",
      "description": "Average end-to-end operation duration per model. This is the total time from sending the prompt to receiving the complete response. Higher values indicate slower models but may also reflect longer responses (more output tokens).",
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sort_desc(1000 * sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_sum{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (increase(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])), 1))", "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}", "refId": "A", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms", "decimals": 0, "color": {"mode": "continuous-BlPu"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}, "mappings": []}},
      "options": {"orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "valueMode": "color", "namePlacement": "left", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false}, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "minVizWidth": 8, "minVizHeight": 16, "maxVizHeight": 300},
      "transformations": []
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {"title": "Token Economics", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-token-economics", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "MCP Tool Analytics", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-mcp-tools", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Code Survival", "url": "/d/copilot-otel-code-survival", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false},
    {"title": "Enterprise Overview", "url": "/d/copilot-enterprise-overview", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false}
  ]
}
